# Stitch-Opt Enterprise Transition Walkthrough

We have successfully completed all 5 phases to transform Stitch-Opt from a single-company internal tool into a massively scalable, autonomous B2B SaaS platform.

This document summarizes the changes, testing status, and current versus new capabilities.

